<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: The world was tough and scary. Surviving each day was hard. But a small group of wild people decided to face it together, rather than alone.

They spent their days looking for food and shelter, and their nights fighting off the cold and danger.

Now, they are starting to form a simple group, helping each other to face the tough world ahead. They are taking their first steps towards becoming a tribe, trying to make life a little less hard for each other.-->
  <VFET_WildMen.scenario.parts.6.text>世界是艰难而可怕的。生存的每一天都很艰难。但一小群野人决定共同面对，而不是独自面对。

他们白天寻找食物和住所，晚上战斗躲避寒冷和危险。

现在，他们开始组成一个简单的团体，互相帮助，面对未来的艰难世界。他们正在迈出成为部落的第一步，试图让彼此的生活变得不那么艰难。</VFET_WildMen.scenario.parts.6.text>
  <!--EN: A group of wild people trying to form a tribe. A classic VFE - Tribal experience.-->
  <VFET_WildMen.scenario.summary>一群正在向部落形态转变的野人 - 部落派系扩展经典的开局模式。</VFET_WildMen.scenario.summary>
</LanguageData>
